flowchart TD
    Start([開始]) --> Init[Patch/Revision初期化]
    Init --> Upload[ブラウザからS3へ<br/>短期PUT署名URLでアップロード]
    Upload --> Complete{完了APIの<br/>構成・サイズ・VersionId・SHA-256検証}
    Complete -->|失敗| UploadFail[UPLOAD_REJECTED<br/>追加ファイル/不正サイズ/不一致]
    Complete -->|成功| Verified[UPLOAD_VERIFIED]
    Verified --> DryRequest[ownerがドライランを申請]
    DryRequest --> QueueDry[Execution + Outboxを<br/>条件付きで作成]
    QueueDry --> DispatchDry[DispatcherがCodeBuildを起動]
    DispatchDry --> GuardDry{CodeBuild実行ガードを<br/>取得できたか}
    GuardDry -->|否| Duplicate[重複起動を抑止<br/>SQLは実行しない]
    GuardDry -->|可| VerifyDry[VersionId・SHA-256再検証<br/>parser・危険SQLポリシー検査]
    VerifyDry -->|拒否| DryRejected[DRY_RUN_FAILED<br/>安全性ポリシー拒否]
    VerifyDry -->|許可| Txn[BEGIN<br/>dry-run.sql実行<br/>件数・SELECT・エラー収集]
    Txn --> Rollback[明示ROLLBACK]
    Rollback --> RollbackCheck{ROLLBACKと<br/>セッション終了を確認}
    RollbackCheck -->|確認| DryLog[Log S3へ新規保存]
    RollbackCheck -->|未確認| RollbackUnknown[ROLLBACK_UNCONFIRMED<br/>承認申請禁止]
    Txn -->|SQLエラー| DryFail[DRY_RUN_FAILED<br/>ログ保存]
    Txn -->|切断/タイムアウト| DryUnknown[DRY_RUN_UNKNOWN<br/>自動再実行禁止]
    DryLog --> DrySuccess{ログ保存と状態反映成功}
    DrySuccess -->|成功| DryOK[DRY_RUN_SUCCEEDED]
    DrySuccess -->|失敗| PersistFail[RESULT_PERSISTENCE_FAILED<br/>成功扱いにしない]
    DryOK --> ApprovalRequest[ownerが承認申請]
    ApprovalRequest --> Approval[指定承認者が確認]
    Approval -->|却下| Rejected[REJECTED<br/>理由とAuditを保存]
    Approval -->|承認| Approved[APPROVED<br/>本実行Outboxを作成]
    Approved --> AutoExecute[追加操作なしでCodeBuild自動開始]
    AutoExecute --> VerifyExec[execute.sqlのVersionId・SHA-256再検証]
    VerifyExec -->|不一致| IntegrityFail[INTEGRITY_FAILED<br/>実行停止]
    VerifyExec -->|一致| Execute[本実行SQLを実行]
    Execute -->|成功| ExecuteOK[EXECUTION_SUCCEEDED<br/>結果ログ保存]
    Execute -->|SQLエラー| ExecuteFail[EXECUTION_FAILED<br/>結果ログ保存]
    Execute -->|切断/タイムアウト| ExecuteUnknown[EXECUTION_UNKNOWN<br/>自動再実行禁止]
    ExecuteOK --> HasRollback{rollback.sqlがあるか}
    HasRollback -->|なし| End([履歴・ログ閲覧可能])
    HasRollback -->|あり| RollbackRequest[ownerがロールバック申請]
    RollbackRequest --> RollbackApproval[指定承認者が承認/却下]
    RollbackApproval -->|却下| RollbackRejected[ROLLBACK_REJECTED]
    RollbackApproval -->|承認| RollbackExec[rollback.sqlのVersionId・SHA-256再検証後に自動実行]
    RollbackExec -->|成功| RollbackOK[ROLLBACK_SUCCEEDED<br/>完全復元を保証しない]
    RollbackExec -->|失敗/切断| RollbackFail[ROLLBACK_FAILED/UNKNOWN<br/>PITR・手動復旧を検討]
    Duplicate --> End
    UploadFail --> End
    DryRejected --> End
    DryFail --> End
    DryUnknown --> End
    RollbackUnknown --> End
    PersistFail --> End
    Rejected --> End
    IntegrityFail --> End
    ExecuteFail --> End
    ExecuteUnknown --> End
    RollbackRejected --> End
    RollbackOK --> End
    RollbackFail --> End
